 Moore toca jazz con gaita; L. Subramaniam, L. Shankar y Shakti exploran la India; Trilok Gurtu lleva la tabla al jazz; Jan Garbarek adapta la canción noruega. Brasil va más allá de la bossa nova con Hermeto Pascoal («un genio», según Airto), Egberto Gismonti, Airto Moreira, Flora Purim y la voz de Milton Nascimento (Clube da Esquina). En Sudáfrica, los Jazz Epistles (1959) lanzan a Abdullah Ibrahim, protegido de Ellington, y a Hugh Masekela; Chris McGregor sigue en Londres. Los cubanos Paquito D'Rivera, Arturo Sandoval y Gonzalo Rubalcaba, los europeos en Nueva York (Petrucciani, Makowicz, Toots Thielemans), el free europeo (Brötzmann, Schlippenbach, Evan Parker, Derek Bailey) y Charlie Haden con la Guerra Civil española completan el mapa.","color":"#a3e635","family":"Fusión: jazz-rock, ECM y músicas del mundo","link":"https://volteret4.github.io/jazz/#fusion-mundial"}],"book_tracks":[],"mentions":[],"podcast":[],"awards":[],"concerts":[],"xref":[],"charts":[{"id":223141266312056,"type":"album","name":"The Topography of the Lungs","list_id":63979376183344,"list":"RYM Top — Experimental — Free Improvisation","src":"musthear","rank":28,"year":1970,"note":null,"yt":"aKK42VGl2XA","scaruffi":null},{"id":91088287030673,"type":"album","name":"Monoceros","list_id":63979376183344,"list":"RYM Top — Experimental — Free Improvisation","src":"musthear","rank":19,"year":1978,"note":null,"yt":"ybIZa2xnoEc","scaruffi":null},{"id":9383672241448,"type":"album","name":"4,4,4,","list_id":230989056896710,"list":"RYM Top — Jazz — European Free Jazz","src":"musthear","rank":170,"year":1980,"note":null,"yt":"pDLKZC0uNZQ","scaruffi":null},{"id":155747677839518,"type":"album","name":"The Snake Decides","list_id":63979376183344,"list":"RYM Top — Experimental — Free Improvisation","src":"musthear","rank":13,"year":1986,"note":null,"yt":"EUIbnQEnWTE","scaruffi":null},{"id":155747677839518,"type":"album","name":"The Snake Decides","list_id":271813569514477,"list":"RYM Top — Jazz — Avant-Garde J